      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>Category:</strong> Medical Emergency Point</p><p>Top international hospital in Hanoi. Emergency phone: +84 24 3577 1100. Open 24/7.</p><p><a href="https://kovitel.com">Visit Kovitel.com</a></p>]]></description>
